	(text "CR nausicaa: i realized today that\nthis guy was backwards (does have\na diode, which will conduct (incorrectly)\non rev. polarity, and also realized that\nwe should pull the source to the gate to\nensure this fella stays off.\n\nCgs ≈ 668 pF, Rg = 2 MΩ gives a time\nconstant of around 1.5 ms, which should\nbe short enough to not hurt anybody, and\ndraws about 1.5 μA while on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 107.696 240.792 0)
